Hebat ya.

02:00:05.364 --> 02:00:06.866
Langsung tersulut emosi.

02:00:15.675 --> 02:00:17.777
Mari kita rapikan sedikit.

02:00:25.685 --> 02:00:26.686
Ini.

02:00:36.095 --> 02:00:37.730
Enak.

02:00:38.531 --> 02:00:42.768
Enak.

02:00:56.315 --> 02:00:57.316
Hap.

