02:05:57.116 --> 02:05:58.117
Buku

02:06:12.965 --> 02:06:14.800
Bener-bener penuh sama Jinpon.

02:06:16.201 --> 02:06:17.202
Senang banget.

02:06:30.749 --> 02:06:32.818
Wah, ini nggak bisa.

02:06:33.218 --> 02:06:34.386
Sesak rasanya.

02:06:39.358 --> 02:06:41.460
