02:10:07.666 --> 02:10:09.768
Enak?

02:10:21.313 --> 02:10:22.314
Enak, kan?

02:10:37.763 --> 02:10:38.730
Sakit.

02:10:42.534 --> 02:10:44.236
Jangan lepaskan.

02:10:49.608 --> 02:10:50.876
Belum?

02:10:54.112 --> 02:11:09.061
Masih seru, nih.
Bisa minta sekali lagi?

02:11:11.496 --> 02:11:15.400
Wah, gila.

02:11:16.435 --> 02:11:17.436
Ah,

02:11:22.040 --> 02:11:23.308
Gila.

02:11:28.614 --> 02:11:30.215
Pemandangan yang bagus sekali.

02:12:28.040 --> 02:12:37.182
Boleh minta tolong ulangi lagi?

02:12:39.051 --> 02:12:42.554
Bisa ulang sekali lagi?

02:12:46.024 --> 02:12:48.927
Kakiku sakit. Bahagia, kan?

02:13:04.876 --> 02:13:12.284
Memang benar, aku bahagia...

02:13:25.897 --> 02:13:30.302
Satu, satu, satu,
satu, satu, satu!

02:13:32.537 --> 02:13:49.154
Aduh, perutku sakit... aduh,
perutku sakit... aduh, perutku sakit...

02:13:54.326 --> 02:14:02.300
Perutku sakit...

02:14:08.407 --> 02:14:16.381
Perutku sakit...

02:14:16.515 --> 02:14:22.587
Sakit... Perutku sakit...

02:14:53.418 --> 02:14:59.424
Perutku sakit.

02:15:06.431 --> 02:15:13.171
Perutku sakit...
Perutku sakit...

02:15:16.174 --> 02:15:20.779
Ayo, lagi, aku mau kamu
bicara lebih banyak...

02:16:06.258 --> 02:16:11.363
Perutku sakit... Enak?

02:16:11.696 --> 02:16:12.697
Enak!

02:16:13.732 --> 02:16:16.334
Gila, klise banget...

02:16:21.439 --> 02:16:30.282
