02:16:37.055 --> 02:16:40.058
Enak...

02:16:40.926 --> 02:16:46.565
Perutku sakit...

02:17:05.584 --> 02:17:07.052
Perutku sakit...

02:17:39.117 --> 02:17:59.571
Aku tak mau makan lagi... tak mau...
Tak mau... aku tak mau makan lagi...

02:18:19.858 --> 02:18:25.530
Perutku sakit...

02:18:32.937 --> 02:18:34.906
Bergerak lagi, ya...

02:18:57.062 --> 02:18:59.097
Tidak, tidak, maafkan saya...

02:19:13.778 --> 02:19:18.817
